<text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
  <body>
    <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="PaLTM4.6.8">
<l>nampi	pimpiyeṉ	ṟu nāṭ ṭumāṉiṭap pēriṭṭāl</l>
<l>nampum pimpumellām nālunā ḷilaḻuṅ kippōm</l>
<l>cemperun tāmaraik kaṇṇaṉpē riṭṭaḻait takkāl</l>
<l>nampikāḷ nāraṇaṉ tamaṉṉai narakam pukāḷ.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg xml:lang="en">
<l>If [one] gives the name of a man from the country,</l>
<l rend="indent">[like] Nambi or Pimbi,</l>
<l>all the Nampis and Pimpis will vanish,</l>
<l rend="indent">having been dispensed with on [merely] the count of four!</l>
<l>If, [however,] having given the name,</l>
<l rend="indent">[you] call out Kaṇṇaṉ, with the big, red lotus [eyes],</l>
<l>O  Nampis, the mother of Nāraṇa will not go to hell.</l>
      </lg>
    </div>
  </body>
</text>
